  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;GIOVANNI EVANGELISTA TORNEFRANZA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza is a Roman Catholic bishop known for his spiritual and diplomatic experience, recently appointed as the Governor of Jamaica."&lt;SEP&gt;"Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza was a diocesan bishop who emphasized the importance of pastoral care and the presence of bishops among their people."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JAMAICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jamaica is an island nation where Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza has been appointed as the new Governor, facing significant social and economic challenges."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRITISH MONARCHY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The British monarchy is the institution that made the appointment of Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza as the new Governor of Jamaica."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KINGSTON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kingston is the capital city of Jamaica where the announcement of Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza's appointment was made."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. SOPHIA BROWN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Sophia Brown is a political analyst at the University of the West Indies who commented on the appointment of Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza as Governor."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF THE WEST INDIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of the West Indies is where Dr. Sophia Brown works and provided commentary on the appointment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CATHOLIC CHURCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Catholic Church is the religious institution Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza serves and represents in his various roles."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VATICAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Vatican is mentioned as the headquarters of the Catholic Church, where Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza has served as a Vatican diplomat."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FANO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fano is a town in Italy where Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza previously served as a diocesan bishop, providing pastoral care to his flock."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIOCESE OF FANO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Diocese of Fano is the area under Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza's pastoral care, where he was involved in daily spiritual and administrative duties."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PARISHES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Parishes are the local churches within the Diocese of Fano that Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza visited and managed."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EARTHQUAKE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An earthquake in 1623 that struck the region of Fano, causing destruction and requiring Tornefranza's immediate response."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RELIEF EFFORTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Relief efforts coordinated by Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza during the earthquake to provide aid and comfort to the affected population."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;20% INCREASE IN VIOLENT CRIME&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A 20% increase in violent crime over the past year is a challenge faced by Jamaica."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STAGNANT ECONOMY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A stagnant economy is another challenge faced by Jamaica."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FAITH AND DEVOTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Faith and devotion describe the qualities that characterize Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza's leadership and pastoral care."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PASTORAL CARE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pastoral care is a key focus of Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza's teachings and duties, emphasizing the importance of listening and guidance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pastoral care refers to the spiritual and administrative duties performed by Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza in his various roles."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SPIRITUAL GROWTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Spiritual growth is a focus of Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza's work, both in the Diocese of Fano and in his new role as Governor."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONFLICT RESOLUTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Conflict resolution is highlighted as a skill that Tornefranza brings to his new role as Governor."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTERNATIONAL RELATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"International relations are seen as a major asset in Tornefranza's new role as Governor."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INVESTMENT AND EXPERTISE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Investment and expertise are areas where Tornefranza plans to leverage his connections to benefit Jamaica."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SEPARATION OF DUTIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Separation of duties is a principle that Tornefranza emphasizes to ensure a clear distinction between his religious and political roles."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLICY DECISIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Policy decisions are the type of decisions Tornefranza will make as Governor, guided by his values and principles."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SHEPHERD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Shepherd is a metaphor used to describe the role of a bishop in guiding and caring for their flock."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIOCESAN BISHOP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Diocesan bishop refers to the position held by Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza, involving leadership and pastoral care within a diocese."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SERMONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sermons are a regular part of Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza's duties, where he discusses faith and morality."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FLOCK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Flock refers to the community of people under the care of Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza, emphasizing the pastoral aspect of his role."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BISHOPS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bishops are mentioned as important figures who should be present among their people, providing guidance and support."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PEOPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"People refer to the community that the bishops serve, highlighting the interpersonal aspect of their roles."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0211</data>
    </node>
